Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.06,0:00:09.66,Default,Speaker A,0,0,0,,You join me in what is undoubtedly the hottest room in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:18.22,Default,Speaker B,0,0,0,,It's got lots of glass, bifold doors, lovely roof lantern. And for the
winter and the spring and the autumn, it's a lovely room to be in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.22,0:00:22.24,Default,Speaker C,0,0,0,,But once that sun gets up in the height of the summer, you just can't be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:27.36,Default,Speaker C,0,0,0,,it's like a greenhouse and if you've got a space like this either a garden room or it could be a.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:32.78,Default,Speaker A,0,0,0,,bedroom loft room or any other room in the house that gets unbearably hot you'll know exactly what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:37.62,Default,Speaker B,0,0,0,,i mean so when people talk about portable air conditioning i'm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.77,0:00:42.83,Default,Speaker C,0,0,0,,a bit skeptical because a lot of the ones I've seen are a bit clunky, they're a bit noisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.83,0:00:48.55,Default,Speaker C,0,0,0,,and they're not really that effective. But this one from my deer is different because.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.55,0:00:53.89,Default,Speaker C,0,0,0,,it's actually a porter split. It's a split unit but you can move it around.
